<title>FRANCE: Publicis 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Publicis 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     185  vs	   152.7</p>
<p>    Net					    338.6  vs	   308.4</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     4.80,  up 20 percent</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			    7.8   no comparison</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 527   no comparison</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   22  vs	    20.5</p>
<p>NOTE - French advertising agency Publicis gave its results in a statement. It said the figures did not include new units in Brazil, Canada, Mexico, Philippines and Singapore. Their turnover totalled 1.7 billion francs and net attributable profit was 14 million francs, which will be consolidated in 1997 accounts.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 dt/pnt</p>
